 50.64 345.28 cm .12549 .164706 .215686 rg BT 12.4 TL/F2+0 9.15 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 40.45 Tm (Important limitations were also repeatable. Structured extraction added unwanted Markdown fences.)Tj T* (Summarization was fast and factually sound but omitted the article's central results. Rewriting added an)Tj T* (unrequested sign-off. Image Description repeatedly omitted a prominent tree and repeatedly misidentified an)Tj T* (empty charging stand as a smartphone. Speech Recognition occasionally made meaningful substitutions.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 50.64 222.08 cm .909804 .968627 .956863 rg 0 117.2 256.36 -58.6 re f* .992157 .92549 .92549 rg 256.36 117.2 256.36 -58.6 re f* .917647 .945098 1 rg 0 58.6 256.36 -58.6 re f* 1 .956863 .847059 rg 256.36 58.6 256.36 -58.6 re f* q 1 0 0 1 9 99.2 cm .086275 .137255 .227451 rg BT 10 TL/F3+0 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 1.8 Tm (STRONGEST RESULT)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 9 76.9 cm .12549 .164706 .215686 rg BT 10.3 TL/F2+0 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.5 Tm (Proofreading: 4 identical correct runs, 1.04 s average.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 265.36 99.2 cm .086275 .137255 .227451 rg BT 10 TL/F3+0 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 1.8 Tm (KEY FAILURE MODE)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 265.36 66.6 cm .12549 .164706 .215686 rg BT 10.3 TL/F2+0 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 12.8 Tm (Fluent and repeatable output could still be incomplete or)Tj T* (wrong.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 9 40.6 cm .086275 .137255 .227451 rg BT 10 TL/F3+0 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 1.8 Tm (OFFLINE EVIDENCE)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 9 8 cm .12549 .164706 .215686 rg BT 10.3 TL/F2+0 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 12.8 Tm (All 6 capabilities worked after an offline restart once assets)Tj T* (were installed.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 265.36 40.6 cm .086275 .137255 .227451 rg BT 10 TL/F3+0 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 1.8 Tm (MEMORY OBSERVATION)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 265.36 8 cm .12549 .164706 .215686 rg BT 10.3 TL/F2+0 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 12.8 Tm (Visible AICore PSS rose from about 209 MiB to 299 MiB after)Tj T* (first prompt; no measured state approached 3 GB.)Tj T* ET Q q .843137 .870588 .909804 RG 1 J 1 j